== claude-desktop.json (json)
mcpServers.unifi-fabric.env:
  - UNIFI_READ_ONLY
  - UNIFI_ENABLE_NETWORK_WRITE
  - UNIFI_PROTECT_MUTATIONS_ENABLED
  - UNIFI_TOOL_FAMILIES
  + UNIFI_WRITE_POLICY=deny
  + UNIFI_WRITE_EXCEPTIONS=family:network=deny;family:protect=deny
  + UNIFI_FAMILY_ALLOW=network,protect,firewall
Dry run: nothing written. Run again with --write to save (keeps a .bak copy).
